      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-3",
      "number": 3,
      "heading": "Prepare the vegetables",
      "blocks": [
        "Peel and roughly chop the onion, peel and finely slice the garlic and roughly chop the broccoli."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "braised-beef-broccoli-3",
        "path": "media/braised-beef-broccoli-3-sketch.webp",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "alt": "Sketch of chopped onions and broccoli on board",
        "credit": "Illustration based on the Gousto recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "number": 4,
      "heading": "Braise the beef",
      "blocks": [
        "Reduce the heat to medium and mix in onion, garlic and cornflour. Add {{beef-water}} boiled water and stock mix, bring to a boil over high heat, then cover and bake for 50 minutes until the sauce has thickened and the beef is cooked through."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Braise the beef",
          "seconds": [
            3000
          ]
        }
      ],
      "image": {
        "id": "braised-beef-broccoli-4",
        "path": "media/braised-beef-broccoli-4-sketch.webp",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "alt": "Sketch of pale casserole lid",
        "credit": "Illustration based on the Gousto recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-5",
      "number": 5,
      "heading": "Wait while it cooks",
      "blocks": [
        "Use the oven time to clear up and set the table."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": []
    },
    {
      "id": "step-6",
      "number": 6,
      "heading": "Bake the rice",
      "blocks": [
        "After the beef has had 30–35 minutes, reboil the kettle. Add rice and {{rice-water}} boiled water to a baking dish, cover tightly with foil and bake 25–30 minutes, until the water is absorbed and the rice is cooked."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Bake the rice",
          "seconds": [
            1500,
            1800
          ]
        }
      ],
