    {
      "id": "step-7",
      "number": 7,
      "heading": "Add the broccoli",
      "blocks": [
        "Stir the broccoli, gluten-free soy sauce, ginger and hoisin into the beef. Return to the oven uncovered for 12–15 minutes until the broccoli is tender and the sauce thickened."
      ],
      "notes": [],
